                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 3  -  Find each panel's centre
Goal: a centre point for every panel.
Idea: Area also returns each shape's centroid. Here we want the
   centroid, not the area.
Watch for: Use the C (centroid) output.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
