                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 4  -  Open the joints
Goal: every panel shrunk slightly about its own centre, leaving
   a joint.
Idea: Scale each panel to 0.95 about its own centroid: the gap
   between neighbours becomes the joint.
Watch for: Scale about each panel's own centre, not the tower's,
   or the panels will slide.
Wire check: joint slider -&gt; F, centroids -&gt; C.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
