                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 5  -  Floor-line mullions
Goal: a horizontal mullion along every floor outline.
Idea: Pipe works on any curve: here the twisted floor outlines.
Wire check: radius slider -&gt; R.</item>
